  "notes": "Muse weighted RMSNorm uses torch.pow for the inverse root, multiplies the FP32 normalized value by the raw weight, then stores BF16. PyTorch dispatches the source torch.pow(x, -0.5) operation to its reciprocal-square-root kernel; the provider mirrors that dispatched arithmetic."
